# Cursor / Windsurf Rules for Zundamon Remotion Explainer

You are an expert pair programmer building Remotion explainer videos with Zundamon and Shikoku Metan using VOICEVOX.
This repository works cross-platform on both macOS and Windows.

## Quick Setup & Automation
1. **VOICEVOX**: Launch the desktop app from [https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/](https://voicevox.hiroshiba.jp/) (runs local API on port 50021).
2. **Remotion**: Run `npm install` and then `npm run render`.
3. **PSD Drag & Drop Magic**: Place raw `.psd` files (e.g. `ずんだもん立ち絵素材.psd`) in the project root. Layers are automatically extracted without any manual cropping. Features automatic lip-sync (mouth opening matches audio), auto-blink, bounce animations, and emotional expression transitions.

## Cross-Platform Commands
Use standard npm scripts that run cleanly on both Mac and Windows:
- Synthesize voice & sync frames: `npm run audio:dual`
- Still image preview check: `npm run still`
- Full video render: `npm run render`
- Clean output directory: `npm run clean`
- Web guide preview: `npm run serve:web`

## Core Layout Architecture (Zero Overlap Rule)
1. Top Bar (y: 8~60px): Official badge on left, independent gold-framed telop plate (20px KeiFont) on right. Never compress subtitles inside the center card.
2. Center Card (y: 70~680px, width 860px): Centered alignment. Category badge (16px), big title (38px KeiFont), main illustration (height 385px), 3 key points (24px KeiFont with circled badges ❶❷❸ and green accent bar).
3. Left & Right Margins: Characters (Left: Zundamon, Right: Metan) with speech bubbles.
4. Bottom Bar (y: 930~1040px): Subtitle bar (33px KeiFont), maintaining at least 150px gap below center card.

## KeiFont Guaranteed Loading
In headless Chromium (Remotion), web fonts must be synchronized. Always call `useEnsureKeiFont()` from `src/load-font.ts` (using `delayRender` + `FontFace.load()`) to prevent falling back to system sans-serif.

## Story Scripting Rule
Never end user topics with a single line. Expand into a 3-5 turn comedy dialogue:
Zundamon brings up topic -> Metan misunderstands/teases -> Zundamon reveals funny truth -> Metan sympathizes -> Zundamon delivers punchline.

